                 <li>Seven abdominal radiographs show a large right cranial-to-mid abdominal soft-tissue mass effect.</li>\n                    <li>Gas-filled bowel is displaced leftward and ventrocaudally.</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"text-block\">\n                <h3>Crucial Negatives & Limitations</h3>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>No convincing mechanical obstruction, free peritoneal gas, or large-volume effusion.</li>\n                    <li>Survey radiographs cannot identify the organ of origin or histologic category.</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n","height":720,"id":"slide_2","note":"","path":"/home/ubuntu/hanon_review/presentation/slide_2.html","width":1280},{"changed":true,"content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <title>Ultrasound Narrows Location, Not Identity</title>\n    <style>\n        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@500;900&display=swap');\n        .slide-container {\n            width: 1280px;\n            min-height: 720px;\n            background-color: #E0F2FE;\n            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n            color: #0F172A;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            padding-top: 80px;\n            padding-left: 80px;\n            padding-right: 80px;\n        }\n        .header-block {\n            border-left: 8px solid #9F1239;\n            padding-left: 40px;\n            margin-bottom: 40px;\n        }\n        h1 {\n            font-size: 48pt;\n            font-weight: 900;\n            line-height: 1.1;\n        }\n        .content-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n            gap: 60px;\n        }\n        .text-block {\n            padding-top: 20px;\n        }\n        ul {\n            list-style-type: none;\n        }\n        li {\n            font-size: 18pt;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n            margin-bottom: 24px;\n            position: relative;\n            padding-left: 32px;\n        }\n        li::before {\n            content: \"■\";\n            color: #7DD3FC;\n            position: absolute;\n            left: 0;\n            font-weight: 900;\n            font-size: 14pt;\n            top: 4px;\n        }\n        .image-container {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 400px;\n            background-color: #000;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n        img {\n            max-width: 100%;\n            max-height: 100%;\n            object-fit: contain;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"slide-container\">\n        <div class=\"header-block\">\n            <h1>Ultrasound Narrows Location, Not Identity</h1>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"content-grid\">\n            <div class=\"text-block\">\n                <ul>\n                    <li>Atypical hyperechoic mass measures approximately 9.0 × 7.5 cm.</li>\n                    <li>Irregular internal fluid pocket may represent necrosis, hemorrhage, pus, or cystic degeneration.</li>\n                    <li>Reported candidate origins: right hepatic lobe, pancreas, or mesentery.</li>\n                    <li>Gallbladder, right kidney, and GI tract reportedly normal; no abdominal lymphadenopathy reported.</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"image-container\">\n                <img src=\"https://private-us-east-1.manuscdn.com/sessionFile/wr2VtTdGVAavsKz6qxARfm/sandbox/slides_resource_iw4pzutrb1dezhssfwnii-c2f46580-e2b-prod-us1_1784172351079_na1fn_L2hvbWUvdWJ1bnR1L2hhbm9uX3Jldmlldy9yYWRpb2dyYXBocy8wOF8xLjIuODQwLjExMzY5ODIwMjYwNzEzMTE0MjA2MDI1MzguODY.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1560,h_1560/format,webp&Expires=1785542400&~eC1vc3MtcHJvY2Vzcz1pbWFnZS9yZXNpemUsd18xNTYwLGhfMTU2MC9mb3JtYXQsd2VicCIsIkNvbmRpdGlvbiI6eyJEYXRlTGVzc1RoYW4iOnsiQVdTOkVwb2NoVGltZSI6MTc4NTU0MjQwMH19fV19&Key-Pair-Id=K2QY5QTL8JSY6C&Signature=MEQCIARGlPhWW0kMsFFNvI5xV9QTWYOu-DedJp971lSlFhZ2AiAI1dHmd25j7jCRO1Vunb6-IZz25r0LDQ0Mb494SmZKgA__\" alt=\"Ventrodorsal abdominal radiograph\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n","height":720,"id":"slide_3","note":"","path":"/home/ubuntu/hanon_review/presentation/slide_3.html","width":1280},{"changed":true,"content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <title>Laboratory Signals Are Concerning but Nonspecific</title>\n    <style>\n        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@500;900&display=swap');\n        .slide-container {\n            width: 1280px;\n            min-height: 720px;\n            background-color: #E0F2FE;\n            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n            color: #0F172A;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            padding-top: 80px;\n            padding-left: 80px;\n            padding-right: 80px;\n        }\n        .header-block {\n            border-left: 8px solid #9F1239;\n            padding-left: 40px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px; /* reduced to pull table up */\n        }\n        h1 {\n            font-size: 48pt;\n            font-weight: 900;\n            line-height: 1.1;\n        }\n        table {\n            width: 100%;\n            border-collapse: collapse;\n            margin-top: 6px; /* reduced */\n        }\n        th {\n            text-align: left;\n            padding: 7px 24px; /* reduced vertical padding */\n            border-bottom: 4px solid #0F172A;\n            font-size: 20pt;\n            font-weight: 900;\n            color: #9F1239;\n        }\n        td {\n            padding: 8px 24px; /* reduced vertical padding */\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #94A3B8;\n            font-size: 18pt;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n            vertical-align: top;\n        }\n        tr:last-child td {\n            border-bottom: 4px solid #0F172A;\n        }\n        .col-signal {\n            width: 25%;\n            font-weight: 900;\n        }\n        .col-result {\n            width: 25%;\n            color: #9F1239;\n            font-weight: 900;\n        }\n        .col-interp {\n            width: 50%;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"slide-container\">\n        <div class=\"header-block\">\n            <h1>Laboratory Signals Are Concerning but Nonspecific</h1>\n        </div>\n        \n        <table>\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                    <th class=\"col-signal\">Signal</th>\n                    <th class=\"col-result\">Result</th>\n                    <th class=\"col-interp\">Interpretation</th>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                    <td class=\"col-signal\">Globulin / A:G</td>\n                    <td class=\"col-result\">3.8 high / 0.7 low</td>\n                    <td class=\"col-interp\">Inflammation, antigenic stimulation, or neoplasia</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td class=\"col-signal\">AST / ALP</td>\n                    <td class=\"col-result\">110 high / 157 mildly high</td>\n                    <td class=\"col-interp\">Compatible with hepatic mass effect; not organ-defining</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td class=\"col-signal\">PrecisionPSL</td>\n                    <td class=\"col-result\">182 mildly high</td>\n                    <td class=\"col-interp\">Equivocal; does not diagnose pancreatitis or pancreatic origin</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td class=\"col-signal\">Phosphorus</td>\n                    <td class=\"col-result\">1.4 low</td>\n                    <td class=\"col-interp\">Clinically meaningful; may contribute to weakness</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td class=\"col-signal\">Neutrophils</td>\n                    <td class=\"col-result\">10,692/µL minimally high</td>\n                    <td class=\"col-interp\">Stress or localized inflammation; no left shift</td>\n                </tr>\n            </tbody>\n        </table>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n","height":720,"id":"slide_4","note":"","path":"/home/ubuntu/hanon_review/presentation/slide_4.html","width":1280},{"changed":true,"content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <title>Normal Results Do Not Exclude a Focal Tumor</title>\n    <style>\n        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@500;900&display=swap');\n        .slide-container {\n            width: 1280px;\n            min-height: 720px;\n            background-color: #E0F2FE;\n            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n            color: #0F172A;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            padding-top: 80px;\n            padding-left: 80px;\n            padding-right: 80px;\n        }\n        .header-block {\n            border-left: 8px solid #9F1239;\n            padding-left: 40px;\n            margin-bottom: 60px;\n        }\n        h1 {\n            font-size: 48pt;\n            font-weight: 900;\n            line-height: 1.1;\n        }\n        .content-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n            gap: 60px;\n        }\n        .text-block {\n            padding-top: 20px;\n        }\n        h3 {\n            font-size: 24pt;\n            font-weight: 900;\n            color: #9F1239;\n            margin-bottom: 24px;\n            border-bottom: 4px solid #7DD3FC;\n            padding-bottom: 12px;\n            display: inline-block;\n        }\n        ul {\n            list-style-type: none;\n        }\n        li {\n            font-size: 18pt;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n            margin-bottom: 24px;\n            position: relative;\n            padding-left: 32px;\n        }\n        li::before {\n            content: \"■\";\n            color: #7DD3FC;\n            position: absolute;\n            left: 0;\n            font-weight: 900;\n            font-size: 14pt;\n            top: 4px;\n        }\n        .highlight-text {\n            font-weight: 900;\n            color: #9F1239;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"slide-container\">\n        <div class=\"header-block\">\n            <h1>Normal Results Do Not Exclude a Focal Tumor</h1>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"content-grid\">\n            <div class=\"text-block\">\n                <h3>Preserved Markers</h3>\n                <ul>\n                    <li><strong>Hepatocellular & Biliary:</strong> ALT, GGT, and bilirubin remain within reference intervals.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Hematologic:</strong> Hematocrit, platelets, and total WBC are normal.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Renal Filtration:</strong> BUN, creatinine, and SDMA indicate preserved kidney function.</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"text-block\">\n                <h3>Clinical Implications</h3>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>No anemia or thrombocytopenia to suggest current major hemorrhage or rupture.</li>\n                    <li><span class=\"highlight-text\">Crucial context:</span> A localized hepatic or mesenteric tumor can still be massive despite modest laboratory changes.</li>\n                    <li>Normal systemic markers do not rule out a severe, space-occupying abdominal lesion.</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n","height":720,"id":"slide_5","note":"","path":"/home/ubuntu/hanon_review/presentation/slide_5.html","width":1280},{"changed":true,"content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <title>Leading Diagnosis Is a Localized Hepatic Mass</title>\n    <style>\n        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@500;900&display=swap');\n        .slide-container {\n            width: 1280px;\n            min-height: 720px;\n            background-color: #E0F2FE;\n            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n            color: #0F172A;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            padding-top: 80px;\n            padding-left: 80px;\n            padding-right: 80px;\n        }\n        .header-block {\n            border-left: 8px solid #9F1239;\n            padding-left: 40px;\n            margin-bottom: 60px;\n        }\n        h1 {\n            font-size: 48pt;\n            font-weight: 900;\n            line-height: 1.1;\n        }\n        .differentials-list {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 32px;\n            padding-left: 20px;\n        }\n        .diff-item {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: flex-start;\n        }\n        .diff-number {\n            font-size: 24pt;\n            font-weight: 900;\n            color: #9F1239;\n            width: 60px;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n            line-height: 1.2;\n        }\n        .diff-text {\n            font-size: 18pt;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n            padding-top: 4px;\n        }\n        .diff-text strong {\n            font-weight: 900;\n            color: #0F172A;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"slide-container\">\n        <div class=\"header-block\">\n            <h1>Leading Diagnosis Is a Localized Hepatic Mass</h1>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"differentials-list\">\n            <div class=\"diff-item\">\n                <div class=\"diff-number\">1.</div>\n                <div class=\"diff-text\"><strong>Primary hepatic mass:</strong> massive hepatocellular tumor favored as a family, not confirmed.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"diff-item\">\n                <div class=\"diff-number\">2.</div>\n                <div class=\"diff-text\"><strong>Mesenteric or omental soft-tissue neoplasm:</strong> including sarcoma.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"diff-item\">\n                <div class=\"diff-number\">3.</div>\n                <div class=\"diff-text\"><strong>Pancreatic-region disease:</strong> pancreatic neoplasm versus focal pancreatitis, phlegmon, or pseudocyst.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"diff-item\">\n                <div class=\"diff-number\">4.</div>\n                <div class=\"diff-text\"><strong>Other hepatic/biliary tumor:</strong> including sarcoma or hemangiosarcoma.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"diff-item\">\n                <div class=\"diff-number\">5.</div>\n                <div class=\"diff-text\"><strong>Inflammatory or benign lesion:</strong> Abscess, granuloma, infected necrotic tumor, hematoma, or benign cystic lesion.</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n","height":720,"id":"slide_6","note":"","path":"/home/ubuntu/hanon_review/presentation/slide_6.html","width":1280},{"changed":true,"content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <title>Two Concurrent Problems Need Separate Workups</title>\n    <style>\n        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?fam