       }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"slide-container\">\n        <div class=\"header-block\">\n            <h1>Two Concurrent Problems Need Separate Workups</h1>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"content-grid\">\n            <div class=\"text-block\">\n                <h3>Urinary Tract Findings</h3>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>Urine: USG 1.060, 3+ protein, 2+ blood, and 11–20 RBC/hpf; UPC 1.3 may be inflated by hematuria.</li>\n                    <li>Possible bladder-trigone thickening: inflammatory/polypoid cystitis versus urothelial carcinoma.</li>\n                    <li>Repeat targeted imaging and clean culture are required.</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"text-block\">\n                <h3>Left Forelimb Findings</h3>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>Forelimb radiographs show no aggressive bone lesion or displaced fracture.</li>\n                    <li>Persistent limb pain/muscle loss may reflect shoulder soft-tissue disease or cervical radiculopathy.</li>\n                </ul>\n                <div class=\"image-container\">\n                    <img src=\"https://private-us-east-1.manuscdn.com/sessionFile/wr2VtTdGVAavsKz6qxARfm/sandbox/slides_resource_iw4pzutrb1dezhssfwnii-c2f46580-e2b-prod-us1_1784172381775_na1fn_L2hvbWUvdWJ1bnR1L2hhbm9uX3Jldmlldy9yYWRpb2dyYXBocy8wMl8xLjIuODQwLjExMzY5ODIwMjYwNzEzMTExMTA1OTQ3NjQuNDY.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1560,h_1560/format,webp&Expires=1785542400&~eC1vc3MtcHJvY2Vzcz1pbWFnZS9yZXNpemUsd18xNTYwLGhfMTU2MC9mb3JtYXQsd2VicCIsIkNvbmRpdGlvbiI6eyJEYXRlTGVzc1RoYW4iOnsiQVdTOkVwb2NoVGltZSI6MTc4NTU0MjQwMH19fV19&Key-Pair-Id=K2QY5QTL8JSY6C&Signature=MEUCIE9dshgzlOV83lE02Eb4l79OmbufesrOxqKghHT-1mMZAiEAu4q-AhASGw5EXIfRjnt4qycCEim0Mvrrp-ahHW4-~PA_\" alt=\"Left forelimb radiograph\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n","height":720,"id":"slide_7","note":