img {\n            max-width: 100%;\n            max-height: 100%;\n            object-fit: contain;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"slide-container\">\n        <div class=\"header-block\">\n            <h1>Contrast CT Is the Pivotal Next Study</h1>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"content-grid\">\n            <div class=\"text-block\">\n                <ul>\n                    <li>Establish organ and hepatic-lobe origin.</li>\n                    <li>Define vascular involvement, enhancement, surgical planes, lymph nodes, and occult lesions.</li>\n                    <li>Characterize the solid and fluid components before selecting a sampling route.</li>\n                    <li>Include urinary tract assessment and complete thoracic staging if neoplasia is suspected.</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"image-container\">\n                <img src=\"https://private-us-east-1.manuscdn.com/sessionFile/wr2VtTdGVAavsKz6qxARfm/sandbox/slides_resource_iw4pzutrb1dezhssfwnii-c2f46580-e2b-prod-us1_1784172381775_na1fn_L2hvbWUvdWJ1bnR1L2hhbm9uX3Jldmlldy9yYWRpb2dyYXBocy8wN18xLjIuODQwLjExMzY5ODIwMjYwNzEzMTEzODE0Njc5NjEuODE.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1560,h_1560/format,webp&Expires=1785542400&~eC1vc3MtcHJvY2Vzcz1pbWFnZS9yZXNpemUsd18xNTYwLGhfMTU2MC9mb3JtYXQsd2VicCIsIkNvbmRpdGlvbiI6eyJEYXRlTGVzc1RoYW4iOnsiQVdTOkVwb2NoVGltZSI6MTc4NTU0MjQwMH19fV19&Key-Pair-Id=K2QY5QTL8JSY6C&Signature=MEUCIHmuYwG4NKi83f52XMQzsHMs-LEpOb7IxSTMaqV1iPsmAiEAxNOt3slNJ9shYhs5-6a42KBfu0C7GM9j6SmlJV0OX4Q_\" alt=\"Lateral abdominal radiograph\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n","height":720,"id":"slide_8","note":"","path":"/home/ubuntu/hanon_review/presentation/slide_8.html","width":1280},{"changed":true,"content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <title>Sampling Must Follow Anatomy and Bleeding Risk</title>\n    <style>\n        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@500;900&display=swap');\n        .slide-container {\n            width: 1280px;\n            min-height: 720px;\n            background-color: #E0F2FE;\n            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n            color: #0F172A;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            padding-top: 80px;\n            padding-left: 80px;\n            padding-right: 80px;\n        }\n        .header-block {\n            border-left: 8px solid #9F1239;\n            padding-left: 40px;\n            margin-bottom: 60px;\n        }\n        h1 {\n            font-size: 48pt;\n            font-weight: 900;\n            line-height: 1.1;\n        }\n        .protocol-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n            gap: 60px 40px;\n        }\n        .protocol-step {\n            border-top: 4px solid #0F172A;\n            padding-top: 20px;\n        }\n        .protocol-step h3 {\n            font-size: 24pt;\n            font-weight: 900;\n            color: #9F1239;\n            margin-bottom: 16px;\n        }\n        .protocol-step p {\n            font-size: 18pt;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n        }\n        .highlight {\n            background-color: #7DD3FC;\n            padding: 2px 8px;\n            font-weight: 900;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"slide-container\">\n        <div class=\"header-block\">\n            <h1>Sampling Must Follow Anatomy and Bleeding Risk</h1>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"protocol-grid\">\n            <div class=\"protocol-step\">\n                <h3>1. Pre-Sampling Assessment</h3>\n                <p>Reassess stability, PCV/TS, platelets, coagulation profile, and phosphorus first.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"protocol-step\">\n                <h3>2. Modality Selection</h3>\n                <p>Select fine-needle aspiration, core biopsy, or direct surgical excision <span class=\"highlight\">after CT</span>.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"protocol-step\">\n                <h3>3. Laboratory Submission</h3>\n                <p>Submit fluid/tissue for cytology or histopathology; add aerobic and anaerobic culture if infection is plausible.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"protocol-step\">\n                <h3>4. Surgical Consideration</h3>\n                <p>A resectable hepatic mass may be better diagnosed and treated surgically than by unsafe percutaneous biopsy.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n","height":720,"id":"slide_9","note":"","path":"/home/ubuntu/hanon_review/presentation/slide_9.html","width":1280},{"changed":true,"content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <title>Immediate Questions for the Specialist</title>\n    <style>\n        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@500;900&display=swap');\n        .slide-container {\n            width: 1280px;\n            min-height: 720px;\n            background-color: #E0F2FE;\n            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n            color: #0F172A;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            padding-top: 80px;\n            padding-left: 80px;\n            padding-right: 80px;\n        }\n        .header-block {\n            border-left: 8px solid #9F1239;\n            padding-left: 40px;\n            margin-bottom: 31px; /* reduced from 80px to pull content up */\n        }\n        h1 {\n            font-size: 48pt;\n            font-weight: 900;\n            line-height: 1.1;\n        }\n        .questions-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n            gap: 60px 80px;\n        }\n        .question-block {\n            border-top: 4px solid #9F1239;\n            padding-top: 24px;\n        }\n        .question-number {\n            font-size: 16pt;\n            font-weight: 900;\n            color: #7DD3FC;\n            margin-bottom: 16px;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            letter-spacing: 2px;\n        }\n        .question-text {\n            font-size: 24pt;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n        }\n        .question-text strong {\n            font-weight: 900;\n            color: #0F172A;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"slide-container\">\n        <div class=\"header-block\">\n            <h1>Immediate Questions for the Specialist</h1>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"questions-grid\">\n            <div class=\"question-block\">\n                <div class=\"question-number\">Question 01</div>\n                <div class=\"question-text\">What is the <strong>organ/lobe of origin</strong>, and is the mass <strong>resectable</strong>?</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"question-block\">\n                <div class=\"question-number\">Question 02</div>\n                <div class=\"question-text\">Does the fluid component represent <strong>necrosis, hemorrhage, abscess,</strong> or <strong>cystic change</strong>?</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"question-block\">\n                <div class=\"question-number\">Question 03</div>\n                <div class=\"question-text\">Is there <strong>vascular invasion</strong> or occult <strong>metastatic disease</strong>?</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"question-block\">\n                <div class=\"question-number\">Question 04</div>\n                <div class=\"question-text\">What <strong>sampling or surgical approach</strong> gives the best diagnostic yield with the lowest risk?</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n","height":720,"id":"slide_10","note":"","path":"/home/ubuntu/hanon_review/presentation/slide_10.html","width":1280},{"changed":true,"content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <title>Clinical Priority: Localize, Stage, and Obtain Tissue</title>\n    <style>\n        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@500;900&display=swap');\n        .slide-container {\n            width: 1280px;\n            min-height: 720px;\n            background-color: #E0F2FE;\n            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n            color: #0F172A;\n        }\n        .slide-content {\n            padding-top: 80px; /* must keep title top padding */\n            padding-left: 80px;\n            padding-right: 80px;\n        }\n        .header-block {\n            border-left: 8px solid #9F1239;\n            padding-left: 40px;\n            margin-top: 0;\n            margin-bottom: 20px; /* reduced from 60 to save vertical space */\n        }\n        h1 {\n            font-size: 48pt;\n            font-weight: 900;\n            line-height: 1.1;\n        }\n        .strategy-block {\n            border-left: 8px solid #7DD3FC;\n            padding-left: 32px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px; /* reduced from 60 */\n        }\n        .strategy-block p {\n            font-size: 22pt;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            line-height: 1.3; /* slightly tighter but font-size unchanged */\n            margin-bottom: 8px; /* reduced spacing between paragraphs */\n        }\n        .strategy-block strong {\n            font-weight: 900;\n            color: #0F172A;\n        }\n        .escalation-block {\n            border-left: 8px solid #9F1239;\n            padding-left: 32px;\n            padding-top: 0; /* removed extra top padding */\n        }\n        .escalation-block h3 {\n            font-size: 24pt;\n            font-weight: 900;